---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tote Bag Canvas Custom: Katalog Model, Spesifikasi & Harga Pabrik"
  description="Katalog lengkap tote bag canvas custom untuk perusahaan, seminar, dan merchandise. Pilihan bobot kain 10-14 oz, jahitan kuat, harga transparan mulai Rp 40.000, MOQ 50 pcs."
  canonicalUrl="https://totebag.web.id/produk/tote-bag-canvas/"
  ogImage="https://totebag.web.id/media/tote-bag-canvas-twill.webp"
  jsonLd={schemaJson}
>
  <!-- Topbar Announcement Strip -->
  <aside class="canvas-topbar py-2 text-center text-white small" style="background-color: var(--brand-primary, #173F38);" aria-label="Informasi konveksi canvas">
    <div class="container">
      Konveksi Tote Bag Canvas Heavy-Duty • Kain Katun Tebal 10-14 oz • Garansi Sablon Presisi &amp; Kirim Seluruh Indonesia
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs & Quick-Nav In-Page Navigation -->
  <div class="container pt-3">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />
    <nav class="quick-nav d-none d-md-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 pb-1" aria-label="Navigasi cepat halaman canvas">
      <span class="small fw-semibold text-muted align-self-center me-1">Lompat ke:</span>
      <a href="#katalog-produk" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Katalog Model &amp; Harga</a>
      <a href="#tabel-harga" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Tabel Harga Grosir</a>
      <a href="#bobot-anatomi" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Spesifikasi Bobot (GSM)</a>
      <a href="#komparasi" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Komparasi Material</a>
      <a href="#perawatan" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Panduan Cuci &amp; Rawat</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">FAQ</a>
      <a href="#penawaran" class="badge badge-cta bg-brand text-white text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill shadow-sm">Minta Penawaran</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Header Section -->
  <section class="section-space-sm pt-3 pb-4 hero-canvas" id="konten">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-lg-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="badge-accent">KATALOG PRODUK &amp; KONVEKSI KANVAS</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title mb-3">
            Tote Bag Canvas Custom: Katalog Model, Spesifikasi &amp; Harga Pabrik
          </h1>

          <p class="lead text-muted fs-5 mb-3" style="line-height: 1.7;">
            Penyedia tote bag canvas custom langsung dari konveksi workshop Malang. Menggunakan kain katun heavy-duty 10 hingga 14 oz yang kokoh, rapi, dan sanggup menahan beban laptop hingga 12 kg. Sangat ideal untuk merchandise korporat, onboarding kit, seminar, dan retail fashion.
          </p>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="#katalog-produk" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
              Pilih Model Produk ↓
            </a>
            <a href="#penawaran" class="btn btn-brand-outline btn-lg">
              Konsultasi WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-muted small">
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Mulai Rp 40.000 / pcs (MOQ 50 pcs)</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Bobot Nyata 10-14 oz (&gt;350 GSM)</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Jahitan X-Box &amp; Keling Logam</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Sablon Waterbased &amp; DTF Tajam</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="position-relative">
            <div class="ratio ratio-4x3 rounded-4 overflow-hidden border shadow-sm">
              <img 
                src="/media/tote-bag-canvas-twill.webp" 
                alt="Tote bag canvas twill tebal warna broken white dan saku custom dengan sablon presisi" 
                width="800" 
                height="600" 
                class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 m-3 px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm border text-dark d-none d-sm-block" style="max-width: 250px; z-index: 5;">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="badge rounded-circle p-1 bg-success text-white" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px;">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="d-block text-brand fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.2;">100% Heavy-Duty Cotton</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.2;">Uji Beban 12 kg • Tahan Cuci Berulang</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARKETPLACE CATALOG SECTION (Tampil Langsung di Depan) -->
  <section class="section-space pt-2 pb-5" id="katalog-produk">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="badge-accent mb-2">PILIHAN MODEL SIAP ORDER</span>
          <h2 class="section-title mb-1">Katalog Model Tote Bag Canvas</h2>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Klik tombol penawaran pada model yang sesuai untuk langsung mengirimkan brief ke tim sales kami.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 mt-md-0">
          <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border px-3 py-2 rounded-pill small">MOQ Standar: 50 Pcs per Desain</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid 6 Model Marketplace Cards -->
      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        {canvasModels.map(item => (
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <article class="card h-100 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm overflow-hidden d-flex flex-column">
              <!-- Product Image Wrapper -->
              <div class="position-relative overflow-hidden border-bottom">
                <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="d-block ratio ratio-4x3 bg-light text-decoration-none">
                  <img 
                    src={item.image} 
                    alt={`${item.name} bahan canvas tebal custom logo`}
                    width="600" 
                    height="450" 
                    class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </a>
                <span class={`position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3 badge ${item.badgeClass} rounded-pill shadow-sm`} style="font-size: 0.75rem; z-index: 2;">
                  {item.badge}
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Product Details -->
              <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                  <span class="text-muted small fw-bold">{item.code} • {item.category}</span>
                  <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border small">MOQ {item.moq}</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">
                  <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="text-decoration-none text-dark hover-brand">
                    {item.name}
                  </a>
                </h3>

                <div class="p-2 mb-3 rounded-2 bg-surface-alt border">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Bobot Kain:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.weightOz}</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Dimensi:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.dimensions}</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                  <div class="text-muted small fw-bold mb-1">Spesifikasi Fitur:</div>
                  <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-1">
                    {item.features.map(f => (
                      <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1">
                        <span class="text-success fw-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>{f}</span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
